  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2. Initialize thicknesses from iteration_05 best candidate [108.66, 56.51, 115.65, 58.86, 122.67, 61.23, 130.04, 61.40, 145.56, 62.94, 152.06, 66.95, 130.76, 114.91, 115.44, 130.11, 120.17, 114.78, 52.69, 53.38] nm. Constrain optimization to layers 0-3 and 17-19 only (8 layers), with bounds of ±8 nm from initialization. Fix layers 4-16 at initialization values. Use line-search algorithm with gradient tolerance 1e-6. Evaluate dual-band objective: maximize transmittance in 1000-1700 nm, maximize reflectance in 300-450 nm, normal incidence, unpolarized light. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum total layer count of 30.",
